# The tab menu's Reload and Load in Background (13 Nov 2026, the owner's calls): that tab's page,
# whichever tab is shown. Load in Background makes the page of a tab with none (or wakes one asleep)
# without switching to it, and is offered only then; Reload loads a tab's page again where it is.
budget rss=800 stalls50=30
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=2
wait 2
# Rows: 0 n=2 (shown), 1 n=1 (behind). Unloaded first (its page put to sleep), so there is something to load.
cra://debug?rowMenu=1&run=Unload Tab
wait 1
cra://debug?rowMenu=1&label=unloaded
expect-log row menu unloaded: .*\|Reload\|Load in Background\|Unload Tab \(off\)\|
cra://debug?rowMenu=1&run=Load in Background
expect-log tab [0-9A-F]+ (loads in the background|loads its discarded page again)
wait 1.5
cra://debug?todayRows=behind
expect-log today rows behind: n=2 \| n=1$
cra://debug?rowMenu=1&label=loaded
expect-log row menu loaded: .*\|Reload\|Load in Background \(off\)\|Unload Tab\|
cra://debug?rowMenu=1&run=Reload
expect-log tab [0-9A-F]+ reloads
